@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam handwritten false
skinparam monochrome false
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam defaultFontName -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif

participant "User Desktop\n(Windows)" as Desk
participant "CascadeBarApp\n(Runtime)" as App
database "UserDefaults\n(com.brunobrise.cascade)" as Prefs
participant "Test Runner\n(make test)" as Tests

== Phase 1: Test Runner Preference Isolation ==
Tests -> Prefs: Read original preferences (orderMode, preferredApps, establishedOrder)
activate Tests
Tests -> Prefs: Run assertion checks with temporary settings
Tests -> Prefs: Restore original user preferences verbatim!
deactivate Tests
note over Prefs: Live user preferences remain\n100% UNTOUCHED during install/test

== Phase 2: User Cascade & Order Serialization ==
Desk -> App: Trigger Cascade (Option+Cmd+C or auto-rearrange)
activate App
App -> Desk: Query visible windows & compute deterministic zRank
App -> App: Layout windows (MRU / Spatial / Alphabetical / Custom)
App -> Prefs: saveEstablishedWindowOrder: [ {appName, title}, ... ]
App -> Desk: Apply repositioning (restackZ = restackZOrder)
deactivate App

== Phase 3: Application Exit & Persistence ==
App -> App: Process Terminates (make install, quit, reboot)
note over App: In-memory arrays deallocated\nDefaults persist on disk in com.brunobrise.cascade

== Phase 4: Seamless Startup Restoration ==
Desk -> App: Cascade Launches (applicationDidFinishLaunching)
activate App
App -> Prefs: savedEstablishedWindowOrder
Prefs --> App: [ {appName, title}, ... ]
App -> Desk: collectStandardWindowsWithOnly:exclude:
App -> App: matchWindows:withSavedDescriptors:
note over App: Established slots 0..N restored!\nWindow slots identical to previous session
App -> Desk: Rearrange preserving slot sequence!
deactivate App

@enduml
